---
title:    "CHR(Curry): Interpretation and Compilation of Constraint Handling Rules in Curry"
citation: "(PADL 2015)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/PADL15.html"
date:     2015-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper proposes an integration of Constraint Handling Rules (CHR),
a rule-based language to specify application-oriented constraint solvers, into Curry.
This integration provides a convenient way to specify and
use flexible constraint systems in applications implemented in Curry.
The implementation is available as a
[Curry package](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/chr-curry.html).
